commit b1325854bc196a69cfa4f2e51b2e285e396c94dc
Author: Bernhard Rosenkränzer <bero@lindev.ch>
Date:   Wed Jul 1 15:06:55 2026 +0200

    Replace optional Rust gitcore with C++26 and drop Cargo
    
    Port varint, hashing helpers, LMAP loose-object maps, and hashfile
    wrappers to C++ with RAII over Git's C types, always build them into
    libgitcore.a, enable compatibility-hash support unconditionally, and
    remove Rust/Cargo from the Makefile, Meson, CI, and contrib crates.

